The scene below is already part of a whole program: where the guide says to return only the fields a handler changes with __PASSTHROUGH__, this program writes every field out; keep doing that. A setting the change adds that the scene settles from (a new kind of bet, a choice) is copied into the scene's own fields when the motion starts, beside the ones already copied there, and settled from that copy: the form may change while it moves.

